v 3
d ipwadh - Inverse-probability weights for treatment non-adherence
d 
d Stabilized inverse-probability weights for time-varying non-adherence
d (and death / loss to follow-up) in randomized trials with recurrent
d events, for an on-treatment Cox or Lin-Wei-Yang-Ying analysis: rate models,
d exact adherent-only split, piece weights, weight diagnostics, optional
d adjusted standard errors, and multiply imputed (mi) data.
d 
d Commands: ipwadh, ipwadh_mi, ipwadhc, ipwadh_split, ipwadh_eval,
d stcox_ipwadh (ipwadh_covlists is an internal helper)
d 
d Requires: Stata version 15 (frame() and mi data: Stata version 16)
d 
d Program by Barna Szabó-Söderberg
d Distribution-Date: 20261011
f ipwadh.ado
f ipwadh_mi.ado
f ipwadhc.ado
f ipwadh_covlists.ado
f ipwadh_split.ado
f ipwadh_eval.ado
f stcox_ipwadh.ado
F ipwadh_mata.do
F stcox_ipwadh_mata.do
f ipwadh.sthlp
f ipwadh_mi.sthlp
f ipwadhc.sthlp
f ipwadh_split.sthlp
f ipwadh_eval.sthlp
f stcox_ipwadh.sthlp
e
